@startuml kairos-kgroup-broadcast-message-sequence
title Broadcast Message to K-Group Members

actor "K-Group Leader" as Leader
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB
participant "Messaging" as Messaging

Leader -> WebAdmin: Open Broadcast Message Modal
Leader -> WebAdmin: Compose message\nSelect all or subset members\nClick "Send"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /kgroups/{id}/broadcast {message, recipients}
API -> DB: SELECT Members' contact info
DB --> API: emails/phones
API -> Messaging: Send emails/SMS
Messaging --> API: Accepted
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

WebAdmin --> Leader: Show "Message sent" confirmation

@enduml
